  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">CTS is an organisation carrying out international cooperation on      behalf of 8 Swedish Chambers. The aim of the contribution is to       strengthen the capacity of sister organisations in a number of        selected countries, one focus area is women economic empowerment. The overall objective is i.a. strengthented competetiveness among         companies in the local private sector.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">CTS &#xe4;r 8 svenska handelskammares organisation f&#xf6;r internationellt     samarbete. Insatsens syfte &#xe4;r att st&#xe4;rka systerorganigationer i       utvalda l&#xe4;nder (&#xd6;stafrika, Zambia, Etiopien och Irak). Genomg&#xe5;ende    tema kommer att vara &quot;women economic empowerment&quot; och man kommer      dessutom att jobba mycket med n&#xe4;tverkande och policy advocacy.        Insatsens m&#xe5;l &#xe4;r st&#xe4;rkt konkurrenskraft hos lokalt n&#xe4;ringsliv.</narrative>
  </description>
